  <body>
    <div id="root"><div class="lp"><header class="lp-nav " style="--p: 0;"><div class="lp-wrap lp-navin"><a class="lp-logo" href="https://supplypulse.de.deplexo.com/"><span class="brand-mark"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 7h12v9H2zM14 10h4l3 3v3h-7M6 19a1.8 1.8 0 100-.01M17 19a1.8 1.8 0 100-.01"></path></svg></span><b>Supply Chain Analytics</b></a><nav aria-label="Sections" id="lp-menu"><a href="https://supplypulse.de.deplexo.com/#findings" class="">Findings</a><a href="https://supplypulse.de.deplexo.com/#pipeline" class="">Pipeline</a><a href="https://supplypulse.de.deplexo.com/#dashboards" class="">Dashboards</a><a href="https://supplypulse.de.deplexo.com/#models" class="">Predictions</a><a href="https://supplypulse.de.deplexo.com/#team" class="">Team</a></nav><div class="lp-navr"><button class="lp-lang" title="العربية" aria-label="العربية"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3a9 9 0 100 18 9 9 0 000-18zM3 12h18M12 3c3 3 3 15 0 18M12 3c-3 3-3 15 0 18"></path></svg><span aria-hidden="true">ع</span></button><a class="btn gold sm" href="https://supplypulse.de.deplexo.com/login">Sign in</a><button class="lp-burger" aria-label="Menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="lp-menu"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"></path></svg></button></div></div><i class="lp-prog" aria-hidden="true"></i></header><section class="lp-hero"><div class="lp-wrap lp-herogrid"><div><h1><span class="lp-57 num">57</span><span class="lp-hero-rest">of every 100 orders<br>arrive late.</span></h1><p class="lp-lead">We followed 180,519 order items from the DataCo dataset through a SQL Server warehouse, Power BI and three machine-learning models. This platform lets your team explore every answer, each person seeing only the data they own.</p><div class="lp-cta"><a class="btn gold" href="https://supplypulse.de.deplexo.com/login">Open the dashboard</a><a class="btn lp-ghost" href="https://supplypulse.de.deplexo.com/#findings">See the findings</a></div><dl class="lp-facts"><div><dt class="num">180,519</dt><dd>order items</dd></div><div><dt class="num">164</dt><dd>countries</dd></div><div><dt class="num">3</dt><dd>years of orders</dd></div><div><dt class="num">17</dt><dd>warehouse tables</dd></div></dl></div><figure><svg class="lp-map" viewBox="0 0 580 400" role="img" aria-label="Orders moving from the hub to five markets. Coral parcels are late."><defs><radialGradient id="lpglow"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#e3b341" stop-opacity=".35"></stop><stop offset="1" stop-color="#e3b341" stop-opacity="0"></stop></radialGradient></defs><circle cx="290" cy="200" r="86" fill="url(#lpglow)"></circle><circle class="hub-ring" cx="290" cy="200" r="30" fill="none" stroke="#e3b341" stroke-width="1.5"></circle><path class="lane" id="lane-LATAM" d="M290 200 Q159 282 84 296" fill="none" stroke="#5cc3c2" stroke-opacity=".4" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="2 7" stroke-linecap="round" style="--i: 0;"></path><path class="lane" id="lane-USCA" d="M290 200 Q173 118 112 104" fill="none" stroke="#5cc3c2" stroke-opacity=".4" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="2 7" stroke-linecap="round" style="--i: 1;"></path><path class="lane" id="lane-EUROPE" d="M290 200 Q334 171 322 74" fill="none" stroke="#5cc3c2" stroke-opacity=".4" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="2 7" stroke-linecap="round" style="--i: 2;"></path><path class="lane" id="lane-AFRICA" d="M290 200 Q338 231 330 330" fill="none" stroke="#5cc3c2" stroke-opacity=".4" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="2 7" stroke-linecap="round" style="--i: 3;"></path><path class="lane" id="lane-PACIFICASIA" d="M290 200 Q425 232 504 196" fill="none" stroke="#5cc3c2" stroke-opacity=".4" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="2 7" stroke-linecap="round" style="--i: 4;"></path><rect width="9" height="9" x="-4.5" y="-4.5" rx="2" fill="#e0644b"><animateMotion dur="5s" begin="0s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M290 200 Q159 282 84 296"></animateMotion></rect><rect width="9" height="9" x="-4.5" y="-4.5" rx="2" fill="#e0644b"><animateMotion dur="5.3s" begin="-1.325s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M290 200 Q159 282 84 296"></animateMotion></rect><rect width="9" height="9" x="-4.5" y="-4.5" rx="2" fill="#e0644b"><animateMotion dur="5.6s" begin="-2.8s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M290 200 Q159 282 84 296"></animateMotion></rect><rect width="9" height="9" x="-4.5" y="-4.5" rx="2" fill="#e0644b"><animateMotion dur="5.9s" begin="-4.425000000000001s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M290 200 Q159 282 84 296"></animateMotion></rect><rect width="9" height="9" x="-4.5" y="-4.5" rx="2" fill="#e3b341"><animateMotion dur="5.7s" begin="0s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M290 200 Q173 118 112 104"></animateMotion></rect><rect width="9" height="9" x="-4.5" y="-4.5" rx="2" fill="#e3b341"><animateMotion dur="6s" begin="-1.5s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M290 200 Q173 118 112 104"></animateMotion></rect><rect width="9" height="9" x="-4.5" y="-4.5" rx="2" fill="#e3b341"><animateMotion dur="6.3s" begin="-3.15s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M290 200 Q173 118 112 104"></animateMotion></rect><rect width="9" height="9" x="-4.5" y="-4.5" rx="2" fill="#e0644b"><animateMotion dur="6.6s" begin="-4.949999999999999s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M290 200 Q173 118 112 104"></animateMotion></rect><rect width="9" height="9" x="-4.5" y="-4.5" rx="2" fill="#e0644b"><animateMotion dur="6.4s" begin="0s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M290 200 Q334 171 322 74"></animateMotion></rect><rect width="9" height="9" x="-4.5" y="-4.5" rx="2" fill="#e0644b"><animateMotion dur="6.7s" begin="-1.675s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M290 200 Q334 171 322 74"></animateMotion></rect><rect width="9" height="9" x="-4.5" y="-4.5" rx="2" fill="#e0644b"><animateMotion dur="7s" begin="-3.5s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M290 200 Q334 171 322 74"></animateMotion></rect><rect width="9" height="9" x="-4.5" y="-4.5" rx="2" fill="#e3b341"><animateMotion dur="7.300000000000001s" begin="-5.4750000000000005s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M290 200 Q334 171 322 74"></animateMotion></rect><rect width="9" height="9" x="-4.5" y="-4.5" rx="2" fill="#e3b341"><animateMotion dur="7.1s" begin="0s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M290 200 Q338 231 330 330"></animateMotion></rect><rect width="9" height="9" x="-4.5" y="-4.5" rx="2" fill="#e3b341"><animateMotion dur="7.3999999999999995s" begin="-1.8499999999999999s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M290 200 Q338 231 330 330"></animateMotion></rect><rect width="9" height="9" x="-4.5" y="-4.5" rx="2" fill="#e0644b"><animateMotion dur="7.699999999999999s" begin="-3.8499999999999996s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M290 200 Q338 231 330 330"></animateMotion></rect><rect width="9" height="9" x="-4.5" y="-4.5" rx="2" fill="#e0644b"><animateMotion dur="8s" begin="-6s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M290 200 Q338 231 330 330"></animateMotion></rect><rect width="9" height="9" x="-4.5" y="-4.5" rx="2" fill="#e0644b"><animateMotion dur="7.8s" begin="0s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M290 200 Q425 232 504 196"></animateMotion></rect><rect width="9" height="9" x="-4.5" y="-4.5" rx="2" fill="#e0644b"><animateMotion dur="8.1s" begin="-2.025s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M290 200 Q425 232 504 196"></animateMotion></rect><rect width="9" height="9" x="-4.5" y="-4.5" rx="2" fill="#e3b341"><animateMotion dur="8.4s" begin="-4.2s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M290 200 Q425 232 504 196"></animateMotion></rect><rect width="9" height="9" x="-4.5" y="-4.5" rx="2" fill="#e3b341"><animateMotion dur="8.7s" begin="-6.5249999999999995s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M290 200 Q425 232 504 196"></animateMotion></rect><g class="node" style="--i: 0;"><circle cx="84" cy="296" r="26" fill="#0b3a42" stroke="#e3b341" stroke-width="1.6"></circle><text x="84" y="294" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" font-weight="700" fill="#fff" font-family="var(--font-display)">LATAM</text><text x="84" y="308" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#a9d6d4">$10.3M</text></g><g class="node" style="--i: 1;"><circle cx="112" cy="104" r="26" fill="#0b3a42" stroke="#e3b341" stroke-width="1.6"></circle><text x="112" y="102" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" font-weight="700" fill="#fff" font-family="var(--font-display)">USCA</text><text x="112" y="116" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#a9d6d4">$5.1M</text></g><g class="node" style="--i: 2;"><circle cx="322" cy="74" r="26" fill="#0b3a42" stroke="#e3b341" stroke-width="1.6"></circle><text x="322" y="72" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" font-weight="700" fill="#fff" font-family="var(--font-display)">EUROPE</text><text x="322" y="86" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#a9d6d4">$10.9M</text></g><g class="node" style="--i: 3;"><circle cx="330" cy="330" r="26" fill="#0b3a42" stroke="#e3b341" stroke-width="1.6"></circle><text x="330" y="328" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" font-weight="700" fill="#fff" font-family="var(--font-display)">AFRICA</text><text x="330" y="342" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#a9d6d4">$2.3M</text></g><g class="node" style="--i: 4;"><circle cx="504" cy="196" r="26" fill="#0b3a42" stroke="#e3b341" stroke-width="1.6"></circle><text x="504" y="194" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" font-weight="700" fill="#fff" font-family="var(--font-display)">PAC. ASIA</text><text x="504" y="208" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#a9d6d4">$8.3M</text></g><circle cx="290" cy="200" r="30" fill="#06232a" stroke="#e3b341" stroke-width="2.5"></circle><path d="M278 207h16V192h-16zM294 197h6l4 5v5h-10z" fill="none" stroke="#e3b341" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><figcaption><span class="lp-dot ok"></span>On time<span class="lp-dot late"></span>Late</figcaption></figure></div></section><section id="findings" class="lp-sec lp-cream"><div class="lp-wrap"><h2>What the data says</h2><div class="lp-find"><article class="rv in lp-f1" style="--d: 0ms;"><h3>The faster the shipping class, the later the parcel</h3><p>First Class promises 1 day and takes about 2. Second Class promises 2 and takes 4. Standard Class promises 4 and mostly delivers on time. The premium tiers are scheduled too tightly for the network to meet.</p><div class="lp-bars" role="img" aria-label="Late deliveries by shipping mode"><div><span>First Class</span><div class="lp-bar"><i style="width: 100%; transition-delay: 0ms;"></i></div><b class="num">100.0%</b></div><div><span>Second Class</span><div class="lp-bar"><i style="width: 79.8%; transition-delay: 120ms;"></i></div><b class="num">79.8%</b></div><div><span>Same Day</span><div class="lp-bar"><i style="width: 47.9%; transition-delay: 240ms;"></i></div><b class="num">47.9%</b></div><div><span>Standard Class</span><div class="lp-bar"><i style="width: 39.8%; transition-delay: 360ms;"></i></div><b class="num">39.8%</b></div></div><small>Late deliveries by shipping mode</small></article><article class="rv  lp-fs" style="--d: 220ms;"><b class="lp-big num">18.7%</b><div><h3>of order items sell at a loss</h3><p>Together they lose $3.88M, almost as much as the whole business earns ($3.97M profit on $33.05M net sales, a 12% margin).</p></div></article><article class="rv  lp-fs" style="--d: 330ms;"><b class="lp-big num">99.7%</b><div><h3>of the late-risk model rests on one input</h3><p>Scheduled shipping days decide the prediction. Customer state, category and segment add almost nothing, so fixing the promise matters more than rerouting parcels.</p></div></article><article class="rv  lp-fs" style="--d: 440ms;"><b class="lp-big num">58%</b><div><h3>of sales come from Europe and LATAM</h3><p>Europe brings $10.87M and LATAM $10.28M of the $36.78M total. Fishing is the largest category at 18.8% of sales.</p></div></article></div></div></section><section id="pipeline" class="lp-sec lp-dark"><div class="lp-wrap"><h2>From raw CSV to this website</h2><p class="lp-sub">Every layer is in the repository, so each number on screen can be traced back to its source.</p><ol class="lp-steps"><li class="rv  " style="--d: 0ms;"><span class="lp-n">1</span><h3>Dataset</h3><p>DataCo Smart Supply Chain from Kaggle. Cleaned to 180,519 rows by 34 columns with zero missing values.</p></li><li class="rv  " style="--d: 140ms;"><span class="lp-n">2</span><h3>SQL Server</h3><p>A snowflake schema: one fact table with 15 dimensions for date, customer, product, geography and shipping.</p></li><li class="rv  " style="--d: 280ms;"><span class="lp-n">3</span><h3>Power BI</h3><p>Four report pages and DAX measures for sales, profit, delay and cancellation, plus a live ticker.</p></li><li class="rv  " style="--d: 420ms;"><span class="lp-n">4</span><h3>Machine learning</h3><p>Three leakage-free scikit-learn pipelines on an 80/20 split: 144,415 rows to train, 36,104 to test.</p></li><li class="rv  " style="--d: 560ms;"><span class="lp-n">5</span><h3>This platform</h3><p>React and Node. Every filter, chart and export runs on the server under row-level security.</p></li></ol><figure class="lp-schema"><img src="https://supplypulse.de.deplexo.com/img/Database_Schema.jpg" alt="Snowflake schema of the SQL Server warehouse" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Snowflake schema of the SQL Server warehouse</figcaption></figure></div></section><section id="dashboards" class="lp-sec lp-cream"><div class="lp-wrap"><h2>The original Power BI report</h2><p class="lp-sub">The four pages the team built. The web platform rebuilds each of them with more filters and per-user access.</p><div><div class="lp-tabs" role="tablist"><button role="tab" aria-selected="true" class="on">Overview</button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="">Sales &amp; Profit</button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="">Shipping &amp; Cancel Rate</button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="">Predictive</button></div><button class="lp-shot" aria-label="Click to enlarge"><img class="swap" src="https://supplypulse.de.deplexo.com/img/Overview.jpg" alt="Overview" loading="lazy"><span>Click to enlarge</span></button></div></div></section><section id="models" class="lp-sec"><div class="lp-wrap"><h2>Three models, one honest result</h2><p class="lp-sub">Late delivery is predictable. Profit per order is not.</p><div class="lp-models"><article class="rv  " style="--d: 0ms;"><h3>Late delivery risk</h3><small>Classification, tuned decision tree</small><div class="lp-m3"><div><b class="num">69.7%</b><span>Accuracy</span></div><div><b class="num">84.9%</b><span>Precision</span></div><div><b class="num">54.4%</b><span>Recall</span></div></div><p>When it says an order will be late, it is right 85% of the time, but it catches only 54% of the late orders.</p><em>Main driver: Scheduled days 99.8%</em></article><article class="rv  " style="--d: 120ms;"><h3>Days for shipping</h3><small>Regression, tuned decision tree</small><div class="lp-m3"><div><b class="num">0.39</b><span>R²</span></div><div><b class="num">0.98</b><span>Mean error (days)</span></div></div><p>Scheduled days explain 99.8% of the model. It explains 39% of the variation in real shipping days.</p><em>Main driver: Scheduled days 99.8%</em></article><article class="rv  lp-weak" style="--d: 240ms;"><h3>Benefit per order</h3><small>Regression, tuned decision tree</small><div class="lp-m3"><div><b class="num">0.02</b><span>R²</span></div><div><b class="num">$54</b><span>Mean error</span></div></div><p>Sales explain 80% of the model, yet R² stays at 0.02. Profit depends on factors the dataset does not contain.</p><em>Main driver: Sales amount 79.7%</em></article></div></div></section><section class="lp-sec lp-cream"><div class="lp-wrap lp-stack"><h2>Built with</h2><div class="lp-stackgrid"><div><h3>Interface</h3><p>React 18, Vite, React Router, Recharts, CSS variables, Arabic and English with RTL</p></div><div><h3>Server</h3><p>Node.js, Express, JWT in httpOnly cookies, bcrypt, in-memory columnar query engine</p></div><div><h3>Data and analytics</h3><p>SQL Server snowflake schema, Power BI and DAX, pandas</p></div><div><h3>Machine learning</h3><p>scikit-learn: logistic and linear regression, decision trees, GridSearchCV</p></div></div></div></section><section id="team" class="lp-sec"><div class="lp-wrap"><h2>Team 5, DEPI</h2><p class="lp-sub">A graduation project by five people, each owning a layer.</p><ul class="lp-team"><li class="rv  " style="--d: 0ms;"><span class="avatar">M</span><div><b>Mohamed Salah</b><span>SQL Server design, snowflake schema and backup</span></div></li><li class="rv  " style="--d: 80ms;"><span class="avatar">D</span><div><b>Donia Ragab</b><span>Data cleaning, EDA, KPIs and DAX measures</span></div></li><li class="rv  " style="--d: 160ms;"><span class="avatar">D</span><div><b>Dalia Hamdy</b><span>Data cleaning, EDA, KPIs and the live ticker</span></div></li><li class="rv  " style="--d: 240ms;"><span class="avatar">O</span><div><b>Omar El-Zayat</b><span>Predictive models and Power BI integration</span></div></li><li class="rv  " style="--d: 320ms;"><span class="avatar">M</span><div><b>Menna Emad</b><span>Power BI dashboard design and visuals</span></div></li></ul></div></section><section class="lp-final"><div class="lp-wrap"><h2>Ready to explore the numbers?</h2><p>Sign in with a demo account to see how each role experiences the same data.</p><a class="btn gold" href="https://supplypulse.de.deplexo.com/login">Open the dashboard</a></div></section><footer class="lp-foot"><div class="lp-wrap"><span>DataCo Smart Supply Chain, 2015 to 2018. Source: Kaggle.</span><a href="https://github.com/Team5-Depi/Supply-Chain-Dataset-Analysis-Final_Project" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Project repository (GitHub)</a></div></footer></div></div>
  


</body></html>
